{
  "tema": 7731,
  "slug": "yo-si-yo-no",
  "titulo": "Using yo sí / yo no / a mí sí / a mí no for contrasting answers",
  "subtitulo": "—No me gusta. —A mí sí. Short answers that say the opposite.",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "To contrast with what someone said: after a negative, yo sí; after an affirmative, yo no. With verbs like gustar: a mí sí / a mí no.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To answer someone briefly and say you do **the opposite**, use **yo sí** (_I do_) or **yo no** (_I don't_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "They say…",
            "You do the opposite",
            "Short answer"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "something negative",
              "you do it",
              "Yo sí."
            ],
            [
              "something affirmative",
              "you don't",
              "Yo no."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With verbs like **gustar**, **encantar**, **apasionar**, **convencer**, which use an indirect object, the answer is **a mí sí** / **a mí no**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It works for any tense: past, present or future (**yo sí**, _I did / I will_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To _agree_ instead, use **yo también / yo tampoco** (see [[7681|me too, me neither]])."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **sí** and **no** are a seesaw. Their side goes down, yours goes up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "—Yo nunca me levanto antes de las siete. —==Yo sí==.",
              "en": "\"I never get up before seven.\" \"I do.\""
            },
            {
              "es": "—Voy a hacer una maestría el año que viene. —==Yo no==.",
              "en": "\"I'm going to do a master's next year.\" \"I'm not.\""
            },
            {
              "es": "—No me gusta ese cantante. —==A mí sí==.",
              "en": "\"I don't like that singer.\" \"I do.\""
            },
            {
              "es": "—Me encanta el arte japonés. —==A mí no==.",
              "en": "\"I love Japanese art.\" \"I don't.\""
            },
            {
              "es": "—Yo no le hablé a Beto ayer. —==Yo sí==.",
              "en": "\"I didn't call Beto yesterday.\" \"I did.\""
            },
            {
              "es": "—Creo que mañana voy a surfear. —==Yo no==.",
              "en": "\"I think I'll surf tomorrow.\" \"I won't.\""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "—No me gusta. —Yo sí."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "—No me gusta. —A mí sí."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "With **gustar**: **a mí**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "—No tengo hambre. —Yo no."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "—No tengo hambre. —Yo sí."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "To contrast with a negative: **sí**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "—Me gustan los tacos. —A mí tampoco."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "—Me gustan los tacos. —A mí no."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "**Tampoco** agrees with a negative; it doesn't contrast."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "parientes",
